														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4216361">
									

<p>I've gone back and forth on this one. On one hand, the effect is relatively neatly explained (although a better mental image could definitely be painted) and the ending logs are good fun (even if I didn't understand them). In addition, the testing logs didn't feel like they were longer than they needed to be and elucidated the effect relatively well.</p>
<p>However, my main issue is that there's no real hook. The Containment Procedures have little substance to them, and reading the description made me think that this was just going to be yet another <a href="/scp-786">SCP-786</a>, even if the concept was different. I had to force myself to continue on to the actual good part.</p>
<p>I'm gonna leave this with a hesitant -1 and see what the rest of the site thinks of this.</p>

